impl: mcache sizes restrictions:

Question: How many cache sizes are we gonna allow to exist ???

    1. on small sizes (up to atleast ~64 bytes), double the sizes [8, 16, 32, 64]
        !disable any size!
    2. on sizes <GREATER THAN> PAGE_SIZE(1024)
        we must permit some level of differentiation
        Ex. from 1024 we dont want to go to 2048,
        but rather to something in between
        OR
        have mcaches be as many as the program requests


 num_elems | type_size
 32                | 64
 64                | 32
 16                | 128
 128               | 16
 8                 | 256
 256               | 8